            "notes": "The deck focuses on utilizing reanimation spells and powerful creatures to quickly overwhelm the opponent and deal damage as efficiently as possible. It includes a variety of tutors, discard spells, and cheap countermagic to disrupt the opponent's game plan and protect its own threats. The commander, Emet-Selch, Unsundered, provides a consistent source of card advantage and recursion, allowing the deck to maintain pressure on the opponent. By combining card selection, disruption, and explosive plays, the deck aims to close out the game before the opponent can stabilize or answer its threats effectively. Overall, the strategy revolves around aggression, resource management, and leveraging the graveyard for maximum impact."
